@Niten Ichi Ryu
explained and it works like a charm. Even with all the recouloring, facesets, facebusts, sprites and whatever you want to set up. If you take your time and import all the stuff you are going to use (which is a bit of work), it will save you a lot of time in the future!
Thanks so much for sharing this awesome tool
@Schlangan
!

